<title>INDIA: Indian soybean, oil prices slip, soymeal rises.</title>
<headline>Indian soybean, oil prices slip, soymeal rises.</headline>
<dateline>INDORE, India 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Soybean prices were slightly down in central Indian market on Thursday but plant delivery prices were steady, dealers said.</p>
<p>Soyoil prices were also down on increased selling from processing plants and refineries against limited demand. Prices were down by 100 rupees per tonne.</p>
<p>Soymeal prices were firm on good export demand against tight supply. Soymeal yellow was $275-276 per tonne in export.</p>
<p>Rapeseed extraction was $128-129 per tonne in export. Rapeseed extraction was 4,400 rupees FOR Bedibunder and was 4,350-4,375 rupees FOR Bhavnagar.</p>
